okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Research how CielAiRouter (OneCiel/ciel-ai-router) can be added as a ciel-runtime provider: protocols, model refresh, per-model parameters. Research only; implementation waits for plan approval."
sources:
  doc: "OneCiel/ciel-ai-router main docs/okf/platform/integrations/clients/external-model-access.md (status verified, 2026-10-01)."
  server_code: "src/app/api/v1/models/{catalogResponse,catalogRequest,catalogPagination,catalog}.ts, src/lib/modelMetadataRegistry.ts (enrichCatalogModelEntry)."
  client_guides: "docs/guides/CLAUDE-CODE-CONFIGURATION.md, docs/guides/CODEX-CLI-CONFIGURATION.md."
  vsix: "packages/ciel-copilot/src/{client,provider,catalogFilter,reasoning,types}.ts (VS Code Copilot Chat LanguageModelChatProvider), read after the user suggested it."
confirmed:
  endpoints: "Unauthenticated probe 2026-10-02 of https://ciel-router-01.ezonebot.com: GET /v1/models, POST /v1/chat/completions, /v1/messages, /v1/responses all answer 401 {error.code AUTH_002 'Authentication required'}. Route files exist for chat/completions, messages (+count_tokens), responses (+input_tokens), models."
  auth: "Authorization: Bearer <router API key> (doc). Claude Code guide: ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN (Bearer) or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (x-api-key) both accepted on /v1/messages; base URL is the server root without /v1."
  model_list: "GET /v1/models?prefix=alias&configuredOnly=true&availableOnly=true returns {object:'list', data:[...]} (doc + VSIX listModels). Lists differ per key; availability can change over time. Optional OpenAI paging limit/after (has_more, last_id). Codex user agents additionally get models: [] (catalogResponse.ts)."
  model_entry_fields: "id, object, owned_by ('combo' for combos), root, parent (dual-prefix mirror), type (absent or 'chat' for chat; audio/image/embedding/rerank/video/moderation otherwise), supported_endpoints, context_length, max_input_tokens, max_output_tokens, input/output_modalities, capabilities {tool_calling, reasoning, thinking, supportsThinking, effort_tiers, vision, attachment, structured_output, temperature} (enrichCatalogModelEntry; combo/auto rows set context_length, max_output_tokens, capabilities directly)."
  reasoning: "Canonical reasoning_effort none|low|medium|high|xhigh; server downshifts unsupported tiers (VSIX reasoning.ts). Effort variants are also advertised as separate ids. Codex guide: host setting Thinking Budget must be passthrough or reasoning fields are stripped."
  streaming: "chat SSE: data: lines, [DONE]; reasoning in reasoning_content with possible duplicates in reasoning_text/reasoning (pick one per chunk); tool_calls deltas; keep-alive comments/empty events."
  vsix_behaviour: "Filters non-chat rows (type set and != chat; supported_endpoints without chat/responses) and dual-prefix mirrors (parent present in the same list); maxOutputTokens = min(model.max_completion_tokens ?? setting 16384, setting); maxInputTokens = context_length - maxOutput; reasoning_effort sent only for catalog-reasoning models unless the user picks one; refresh clears the cache and re-lists."
  vsix_field_mismatch: "VSIX reads max_completion_tokens, while the server enrichment emits max_output_tokens (types.ts vs modelMetadataRegistry.ts). Whether any row carries max_completion_tokens is not confirmed."
ciel_runtime_state:
  provider_pattern: "Tabitoken (d81eb00) is the closest pattern: OpenAICompatibleProviderAdapter, root base URL, chat_path /v1/chat/completions, models_path /v1/models, anthropic_base_url = root, dual protocol."
  catalog_projection: "provider_catalog_sources.model_info_from_response -> project_model_info: context from model_context() (context_length is read) -> max_model_len; other fields only via adapter.project_model_metadata (base keeps owned_by/root/object)."
  spec_application: "ProviderModelSpecService.apply (provider_model_specs.py) writes only max_model_len from the cached catalog info (settings_strategy standard). Catalog max_output_tokens is not applied by any shared code; per-model output caps exist only as hard-coded adapter profiles (OpenRouter, Kimi, ...)."
  stream_reasoning: "sse_stream_collection.py:191 and streaming_anthropic.py:2238 read only delta.reasoning_content: duplicates in reasoning_text/reasoning are not doubled; a stream that only fills reasoning or reasoning_text would lose its reasoning (not observed on CielAiRouter)."
  model_cache: "model list/info cache key (provider_model_metadata_context.py:48-63) holds provider, base_url, model_api_base_url, account_id, custom_models and only key/nokey - not which key. Switching to another CielAiRouter key keeps the previous key's list until the TTL or a forced refresh."
live_with_user_key (key given by the user in chat 2026-10-02; kept only in a scratchpad header file, never in the repo or command lines):
  catalog: "GET /v1/models?prefix=alias&configuredOnly=true&availableOnly=true -> 200, 108 KB, 225 rows (unfiltered /v1/models: 948 rows, 420 KB). owned_by claude 72, claude-web 61, codex 51, chatgpt-web 18, deepseek-web 14, openai 5, combo 4 (WebTokens, ASTRA, ciel-sol, 'ciel-Opus 5.5'). No duplicate ids, no parent mirrors in alias mode."
  fields: "context_length 222/225, max_output_tokens 189, max_input_tokens 180, capabilities 225 (tool_calling, reasoning on all; effort_tiers on 166). supported_endpoints/api_format on 48 rows: ['responses'] 47, ['chat'] 1."
  non_chat_rows: "type=image on codex/gpt-5.6-sol|terra|luna (output_modalities image, no context_length). openai/gpt-realtime, gpt-audio-1.5, gpt-transcribe, gpt-live-transcribe have no type and no modalities (only context_length 128000): the type filter alone keeps them."
  tool_calling_false: "12 rows: combo WebTokens and 11 claude-web rows."
  effort_tiers_values: "[none,low,medium,high,xhigh,max] 99, [low..xhigh,max] 37, [low..xhigh,max,ultra] 30, none 59 (combos carry none). Effort variants are also separate ids (cc/claude-sonnet-5-5-low ...)."
  id_with_space: "'ciel-Opus 5.5' (combo)."
  requests: "chat non-stream ASTRA -> 200 'OK' in 3.0 s (served model gpt-6-astra-medium); chat stream cc/claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 reasoning_effort low -> 200, content '391', no reasoning deltas; chat stream cc/claude-sonnet-5-5 reasoning_effort high -> 200, 7 content deltas, no reasoning deltas, no non-data lines; chat stream ASTRA with a function tool -> 200, 2 tool_calls deltas assembling get_time {city: Seoul}, finish tool_calls; POST /v1/messages cc/claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 -> 200 Anthropic message 'OK'; POST /v1/responses ASTRA -> 200 status completed, output [message]."
vsix_model_refresh (user: re-check how the VSIX extracts every usable model):
  path: "Every refresh path (refreshModels command, configuration change, key entry, panel status) ends in CielAiRouterClient.listModels(): GET /v1/models?prefix=alias&configuredOnly=true&availableOnly=true, then selectChatModels (client.ts:92-111, provider.ts:51-90, extension.ts:45-81,240). The refresh clears cachedModels/reasoningModelIds and fires onDidChangeLanguageModelChatInformation."
  server_side: "availableOnly=true runs selectAvailableCatalogModels (catalogAvailability.ts, added in f4edb04cf 2026-10-01): a non-combo row stays only if an active connection of its provider exists, is allowed for the key (allowedConnections), does not exclude the model, advertises it in its synced inventory (effort suffixes mapped to the base id), is not in cooldown, not a locked model and (codex) not an unavailable child; a combo stays when any nested target can route. Read-only: no inference, token refresh or probe. Server journal 04-copilot-ready-models-and-installation.md: a readiness snapshot, not an inference guarantee; unsynced inventory fails open."
  measured: "Same key 2026-10-02: prefix=alias 728 rows; + configuredOnly 728; + availableOnly 225 (503 removed, e.g. aihorde/*); selectChatModels on the 225 -> 222 (drops the 3 type=image codex/gpt-5.6-* rows)."
  correction: "The earlier plan's extra name-based filter (realtime/audio/transcribe) is not what the VSIX does; the VSIX keeps those 4 openai rows."
claude_code_parameters (user: which parameters Claude would use - max input/output, streaming, thinking):
  ciel_launch_env: "claude_environment.apply_common: config max_output_tokens -> CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS (also the router output cap; unset = Claude Code's own default, see config_migrations anthropic_drop_preset_output_tokens_20260610); context limit -> CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS and CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW; effort_level -> CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL; capability string -> ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_MODEL_OPTION(_SUPPORTED_CAPABILITIES)."
  capability_source: "claude_capabilities: pcfg claude_code_supported_capabilities, else anthropic_model_policy.infer_capabilities by model name: opus-5/sonnet-5/opus-4-[78] -> effort,xhigh_effort,max_effort,thinking,adaptive_thinking,interleaved_thinking; fable -> without interleaved; non-Claude names (ASTRA) -> none."
  router_cap: "provider_request_builder.cap_anthropic_body (non-anthropic providers): ratio cap of max_tokens, compaction against context_limit - output - reserve, final cap_output."
  live_messages: "A) cc/claude-sonnet-5-5 stream thinking adaptive + output_config.effort high -> 200, blocks [thinking (thinking_delta + signature_delta), text], usage output_tokens_details.thinking_tokens 32. B) ASTRA same body -> 200, blocks [text] only (no thinking block). C) cc/claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 max_tokens 100000 (catalog max_output_tokens 64000) non-stream -> 200 'OK': the server did not reject an over-cap max_tokens; how it handled it is not visible."
omniroute_translation (user: refer to how the original OmniRoute converts; web search + source):
  provenance: "CielAiRouter's VSIX UPSTREAM.md: diegosouzapw/OmniCopilot 1.3.0 (MIT); the server is a fork of diegosouzapw/OmniRoute (public, default branch release/v3.8.52). OmniRoute wiki Architecture: hub design Source -> OpenAI (hub) -> Target, translators under open-sse/translator/{request,response,helpers}."
  fork_diff: "Fork vs OmniRoute: thinkingBudget.ts (service and openai-to-claude helper) identical except a global key name; claude-to-openai.ts differs only in env var names and one image-url branch; openai-to-claude.ts adds thinking.display passthrough and a Copilot summary path. The parameter mapping below is shared."
  thinking_modes: "open-sse/services/thinkingBudget.ts: passthrough (default; client fields unchanged, 'required for Codex visible thinking'), auto (strips reasoning/reasoning_effort/thinking/thinking_config), custom (fixed budget), adaptive (scaled). EFFORT_BUDGETS none 0, low 1024, medium 10240, high/xhigh/max 131072 (capped later)."
  claude_to_openai: "request/claude-to-openai.ts:289-307: output_config.effort (Claude Code) -> reasoning_effort verbatim; else thinking.enabled budget_tokens -> low <=1024, medium <=10240, high <131072, xhigh >=131072; adaptive without effort sets nothing."
  openai_to_claude: "request/openai-to-claude.ts:219-266: reasoning_effort -> max downshifted to high when the model lacks max, xhigh to high when unsupported; adaptive-only models (Opus 4.7+/Fable 5) get thinking adaptive + output_config.effort; max/xhigh -> adaptive + effort; low/medium/high -> enabled budget 1024/10240/131072. adaptive on a non-adaptive model is downgraded to enabled with a safe budget."
  max_tokens: "openai-to-claude/thinkingBudget.ts fitThinkingToMaxTokens: max_tokens = min(caller room + budget, model output cap), budget shrunk to fit, thinking dropped if < 1024; without thinking max_tokens is capped to the model cap. helpers/maxTokensHelper.ts: default when absent, raised to DEFAULT_MIN_TOKENS when tools are present."
  reasoning_fields: "utils/reasoningFields.ts: readable reasoning = reasoning_content || reasoning; reasoning_text/thinking/thought/reasoning_details are the 'unsupported' fallback."
  live_checks: "D) cc/claude-sonnet-5-5 /v1/messages thinking disabled -> text only, thinking_tokens 0 (client thinking control reaches upstream on this key). E) /v1/responses ASTRA stream reasoning {effort high, summary auto} -> reasoning item (encrypted_content) + reasoning_summary_text deltas '**Calculating 17x23**' + text, reasoning_tokens 15. Compare B) Claude Code style /v1/messages to ASTRA returned no thinking block."
not_verified:
  - "Reasoning deltas (reasoning_content and its duplicates) were not emitted in the streams tried, so the duplicate-field behaviour is known only from the doc and the VSIX source."
changes: "none (research only)"
